              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "nightstar"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The recipe was great- I made it for my friend's birthday and our classmates devoured it. Personally, it was too chocolatey for me but noone else minded! I used \"hot fudge sauce II\" from this website and it worked very well.",
            "datePublished": "2007-03-15T10:09:47.797Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
