            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great pie. I made the following modifications: \r\n- removed the nuts\r\n- chopped up semisweet bakers chocoloate and sprinkled it over the fudge\r\n- placed the whipped cream on the side\r\nIt was a big hit. Super-dense-intense chocolation.",
